1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,263
Watch the gas.

2
00:00:01,263 --> 00:00:05,585
Remove the wall, and the molecules spread out through the whole box.

3
00:00:05,585 --> 00:00:08,281
They never all gather back on one side.

4
00:00:08,281 --> 00:00:12,109
There are vastly more ways to be spread out than to be bunched up.

5
00:00:12,109 --> 00:00:14,557
Nature drifts towards disorder.

